  "sourceTitle": "Open Source Kernel in Qwen3.6-35B-A3B for AMD MI350X: 78,498 output tok/s on 8 GPUs",
  "sourceBodyHash": "544c518b229eee54a0540063341531779d5de9316687833f87f47190471d81ea",
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
