  "createdAt": "2026-09-09T19:56:21.134564Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-11T08:56:57.224841Z",
  "totalBlocks": 13,
  "translatedBlocks": 13,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4cfd9154f06a8785",
      "translationZh": "事情是这样的，几乎所有人都用 NVIDIA 来运行他们的 LLMs，我们也一样。我们接触过的很多人用的是 RTX PRO 6000，甚至是 H100、B300。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "35aa8c97f5784830",
      "translationZh": "似乎所有人的目光都聚焦在 NVIDIA 上。不过，我们算了一下，单看原始算力，AMD GPU MI350X 比 NVIDIA B200 更高。那这是怎么回事？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edfea5ade559a030",
      "translationZh": "显然，问题在软件上：ROCM 不如 CUDA 成熟，其软件栈也仍然落后。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ecf5f9669ed81149",
      "translationZh": "不过，几周前我们拿到了一些 MI350X，用来做实验和开发。我们针对 Qwen 3.6 35B A3B 优化了 AMD 技术栈，一直深入到内核层面，得到的结果已经相当接近 NVIDIA 的同类产品。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84c4710900264545",
      "translationZh": "根据我们的基准测试，我们得到的结果是：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bc5a8b4ab821e6d7",
      "translationZh": "1x MI350X：输出速度为 11,161 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9f497e326c2b474d",
      "translationZh": "8x MI350X：输出速度峰值为 81,331 tok/s，平均值为 78,498.66 tok/s",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8ae31d0889e20e84",
      "translationZh": "在这项 8-GPU 基准测试中，这一吞吐量是 vLLM 的 2.16x。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a64b5166d33d5b49",
      "translationZh": "我们决定在我们的 github 上开源我们的内核和其他相关东西",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "504b1cd8405a7b4f",
      "translationZh": "也会写博客，介绍我们所做的事情背后的故事",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5f643b211189b8e3",
      "translationZh": "不过，我们还没做完。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "73c59236a2b00362",
      "translationZh": "我们学到的一点是：一旦内核足够快，瓶颈就转移到了调度、图覆盖、循环状态、路由，甚至 HTTP 序列化上。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5d472cb23fffe830",
      "translationZh": "由 /u/SmilingGen 提交",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
